# Block 5A-W-33 — raw GSC / Bing / eBay export files for offline analysis.
# Never committed. The analyzer reads them locally; only the generated
# markdown / CSV reports under seo/reports/ are committed (manually).
seo/exports/

# Block 5A-W-50H — manual Japanese set-asset intake.
# The per-set inbox folder holds user-supplied image binaries that are
# never committed. The scaffold script recreates the folder structure
# locally. Only manual-assets/jp/README.md + the two indexes ship.
manual-assets/jp/inbox/
.vercel

# SEO Mission Control — never commit BigQuery / GSC exports or credentials.
# NOTE: production auth uses Vercel OIDC → Google Workload Identity Federation.
# No service-account JSON key is expected to exist anywhere. The *.json /
# credentials/ patterns below are defence-in-depth against an accidental key
# arriving from an unrelated context.
credentials/
*.serviceaccount.json
gcp-*.json
seo-bq-inspection-*.json
reports/seo-bq-inspection-*.json
reports/seo-bq-*.json
